@host = http://localhost:5046

### 1) Login como administrador
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@estoque.com", "password": "Admin@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 2) Quem sou eu
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Categorias
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Criar produto
POST {{host}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 2, "code": "FR-001", "name": "Frita transparente", "unit": "kg", "minimumStock": 100 }

### 5) Entrada de estoque
POST {{host}}/api/stock/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 500, "referenceDocument": "NF-1234" }

### 6) Saída
POST {{host}}/api/stock/exits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 50, "reason": "consumption" }

### 7) Reservar
POST {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 120 }

### 8) Cancelar reserva
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9) Consumir reserva (use uma nova reserva)
POST {{host}}/api/reservations/1/consume
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10) Ajuste manual (exige motivo e justificativa)
POST {{host}}/api/stock/adjustments/decrease
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 5, "reason": "inventoryCorrection", "justification": "Contagem física divergente" }

### 11) Produto com saldo atual
GET {{host}}/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12) Histórico de movimentações
GET {{host}}/api/stock/movements?productId=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13) Criar usuário Operador
POST {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Maria Operadora", "email": "maria@estoque.com", "password": "Senha@1234", "role": "operator" }

### 14) Erro esperado: saída maior que o disponível (422 insufficient_stock)
POST {{host}}/api/stock/exits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 99999 }